    "text": "<p>The reagent, from the following, which converts benzoic acid to benzaldehyde in one step is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ead2d568-d3fa-4b94-acb2-55283d1ae64a-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 159px;\" /></p>",
